-- check/good: an unannotated `pub` declaration's inferred scheme carries the
-- constraints its body raised, and that scheme IS the module's interface
-- (§6.4, `fast-compiler.md` §8.1). This is the cost report 18 §2.3 predicts,
-- made observable: the `.iface` golden shows the `where` clause nobody
-- wrote, and an edit to the body that adds an operation changes it.
pub bigger a b = a < b


pub same a b = a == b
